      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; HackSmarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Difficulty:&lt;/strong&gt; Medium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OS:&lt;/strong&gt; Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attacker IP:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;10.200.84.107&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target IP:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;10.0.23.202&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objective was to assess DarkHaven&amp;rsquo;s Virtual Desktop Infrastructure (VDI), escape the restricted kiosk environment, obtain additional credentials, and escalate privileges to Administrator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
